          "snippet": {
            "line": 361,
            "text": "def cast {x y : X} (γ : Homotopic.Quotient x y) {x' y'} (hx : x' = x) (hy : y' = y) :\n    Homotopic.Quotient x' y' :=\n  _root_.Quotient.map (fun p => p.cast hx hy) (fun _ _ h => h) γ"
